function field(label,type,key,value='',required=false){return `<label class="field"><span>${label}</span><input type="${type}" name="${key}" value="${esc(value)}" ${required?'required':''} ${type==='number'?'step="0.01" min="0.01"':''}></label>`;}
function formPet(pid){return `<label class="field"><span>宠物</span><select name="petId" required>${state.current==='all'&&!pid?'<option value="">请选择一只宠物</option>':''}${state.pets.map(p=>`<option value="${p.id}" ${(pid||state.current)===p.id?'selected':''}>${esc(p.name)}</option>`).join('')}</select></label>`;}
function recordForm(){const r=state.records.find(r=>r.id===editId),t=state.tasks.find(t=>t.id===completeId);photos=r?.photos?[...r.photos]:[];const title=t?'完成'+activity:r?'编辑'+activity:'记录'+activity;return head(title,origin)+`<form id="recordForm">${formPet(t?.petId||r?.petId)}${t?`<div class="paper"><small>原计划时间</small><h3>${date(t.at)} ${clock(t.at)}</h3></div>`:''}${field('实际完成日期与时间','datetime-local','at',local(r?.at||Date.now()),true)}${activity==='体重'?field('体重（kg）','number','value',r?.value||'',true):activity==='喂食'?field('食物名称','text','product',r?.product||'')+field('食用量','number','value',r?.value||'')+field('单位','text','unit',r?.unit||'g'):['驱虫','用药','疫苗'].includes(activity)?field('产品名称','text','product',r?.product||'')+field('实际用量与单位','text','dose',r?.dose||''):''}<label class="field"><span>${['日记','照片'].includes(activity)?'正文':'备注'}（可选）</span><textarea name="note" maxlength="500">${esc(r?.note||'')}</textarea></label><h2>照片（可选）</h2><div class="photos" id="photos">${photos.map(p=>`<img src="${p}" alt="记录照片">`).join('')}</div><label class="photoLabel">＋ 添加照片<input id="photoInput" type="file" accept="image/*" multiple></label>${t?.repeat==='interval'?`<div class="paper" id="nextPreview"></div>`:''}${!t&&!r?'<label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="next">设置下次提醒</label>':''}<p class="note muted">${t?'确认后生成生活记录，并更新本次安排。':'记录实际发生的事情，可以补录过去。'}</p><button class="primary wide" type="submit">${t?'确认完成':'保存记录'}</button></form>`;}
